{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:d/da/jzmgdkif5612rv4e2j9th1n05dyed7u.mp3","text":"日程安排我都记录好了，需要的话，随时可以向我确认。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/77/5spet9i38f9l38wpngozshv2cb9lvm9.mp3","text":"会见血的任务，别让小姐去，让只能在阴影里生存的人去就够了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/n0jsggk8ylc1t3oocmpfmxth7y1eqxw.mp3","text":"我不会告诉你有关小姐的任何私人情报。当然，你的私人情报我也不会告诉任何人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/7feduhl8j8e3540jnbh8y9m725dvggc.mp3","text":"博士，我是保镖，我的任务是保护你，而不是做你的聊天对象。如果你想找人说话，我建议你去找其他人，不要和小姐一样，总是找我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5f/fva08h56r3ksb5e2cunyjqirjztwfhw.mp3","text":"我擅长的东西？杀人，保护人，还有......泡红茶。别露出那种表情，毕竟小姐的手艺......咳，总之，我很擅长。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/jbuczalns5zjbp70b38q33ps8tm4a3r.mp3","text":"博士，根据迄今为止各种任务的危险程度，我认为，除了我的保护之外，你还需要学习一点防身术。否则，就连我也没有自信，能在所有情况下使你安然无恙。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/q1grs1bz9l5dcfhoon340jp0riu23v8.mp3","text":"......一旦手上沾染鲜血，就再也不能回头了，博士，我不希望你也跨出这一步，会脏手的事，就交给我来吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/28/lz146arfnpb3z3p047edc85y4wo9g1v.mp3","text":"想听我复仇的经历？你会睡不好觉的，博士。不过......真奇怪，我居然会有想说给你听的冲动......那么，去酒吧吧。这会是个不短的故事。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/lkkxehsluc8b1ulpt7hawa9c0klyi80.mp3","text":"罪孽深重的人不会有好下场，我心知肚明。只是在遇见小姐和博士你之后......如果能早一点遇见你们，我就不会仅仅是个凶手了。即使是现在也不晚？博士，你这句话，也是真心的吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:7/71/qct3owb90aze6aob08q0vauaon4lbgs.mp3","text":"......就这么睡着了吗，和小姐一样，真是一点警戒心都没有。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/seddosetcltyfjwos5v2jzdh9ver6s9.mp3","text":"我是锡兰小姐的私人保镖，黑，跟随小姐加入罗德岛。可能的话，希望尽量让我和小姐一起行动。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/15/iyea0awb59vwrw4jzetxsmouhaoorc2.mp3","text":"罗德岛充斥着战场上的怪物，这样的战斗，我只能尽量模仿。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/1m749bgapm07s25t6qqjvltfhobxxeo.mp3","text":"现在，我明白了，为什么罗德岛会需要我......你们的理想，比我做过的事要疯狂百倍。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:9/94/dgxqvrrj2awltdy5twa5crhagj46adv.mp3","text":"要唤醒我过去的回忆吗，没有问题。如果是你的话，也许能驯化我们战斗中的那些邪恶。请一定，要驯化我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/9ct2j0cj96xrslk6mr09xedgtdxe8n0.mp3","text":"任务？知道了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/p9yoxpdjx8xkp6knwx6lupp92bk3e04.mp3","text":"听我指挥。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:4/45/j6n8asjey3dr1psjv441dzbp1z3bwxr.mp3","text":"走吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/su95epyzuahsm0flz9c24r4idlrljnm.mp3","text":"让他们有来无回。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:8/80/ofnel1akwsycjkbsii6z1nmfqjjbme7.mp3","text":"哪里需要我？","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/hjkhztqrim19rjdxbj6ran0oumx18ik.mp3","text":"在。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:4/47/m0ufrdmp4ybt9nn5jvs717gh2v0txm2.mp3","text":"这个位置......不错。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/a2msqzq211liklhg2bfb4q2of749sdv.mp3","text":"他们跑不了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/lnbujl3p6pmx1cewyg20q71g7496gmp.mp3","text":"我看见你了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/83/dwlq1dmqv2mo9towqidzz66gp55lq07.mp3","text":"真显眼。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/a4wydm0fmbhnepsbmo0wozlup4wrcin.mp3","text":"才这点人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/48a735u8o3cmu8whtoyvos6nc44c3sz.mp3","text":"小姐有仁慈之心，我没有。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/03/6ht9qjzd9o484qs6adexhhbiz9ywn22.mp3","text":"博士，这种危险的任务，你指挥的地方离战场越远越好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/r6z91x8x25rjydph9ybiiien3940w89.mp3","text":"按照你的指示，没有漏网之鱼。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/db/3o9vq3xx49r2l8t22cync2kiyfw25q1.mp3","text":"确认周围已经安全了，下一步怎么做？","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/joa9b3o3yiz89uht1oynq8iyp56zhpv.mp3","text":"博士，走，我会优先确保你的安全。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/rahb4n8c7l0yrpvr0q1rlp5lby462ek.mp3","text":"巡逻吗？我知道了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:5/50/lnt71qojwwndpnrgxigho92aibpb2p4.mp3","text":"小心走火，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/slr53wmmewmvnxbze5rzhco1t2aub17.mp3","text":"博士，有什么情况吗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:0/09/5mjyhwuqy3jjhwys1kf8gs9xo0kybzu.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/sn4bk0dboykpk1yy9762adejnzxv57l.mp3","text":"新年？我对新年的期待在很小的时候就消失了，但......锡兰小姐喜欢。以前每年年末，我都会去维多利亚接她回家，听她讲留学时的见闻。你要是愿意，待会儿可以过来一起喝杯红茶。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/h164midkvruaqrodoqur4bmpyrqoju5.mp3","text":"即使在基地里，也不要太过松懈，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_340_shwaz/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4b/1au5o74o6uaei4ixtzqmiqwek6asmev.mp3","text":"日程安排我都记录好了，需要的话，随时可以向我确认。","alt":"voice/char_340_shwaz/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/79/31ijuyf2ji68z08ge2c60w8awrmcur6.mp3","text":"会见血的任务，别让小姐去，让只能在阴影里生存的人去就够了。","alt":"voice/char_340_shwaz/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/jdfotzqsq9d3t8e0iva03ysismrs1sj.mp3","text":"我不会告诉你有关小姐的任何私人情报。当然，你的私人情报我也不会告诉任何人。","alt":"voice/char_340_shwaz/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/83n9lys7jdju6b5898oiglayuzkhrep.mp3","text":"博士，我是保镖，我的任务是保护你，而不是做你的聊天对象。如果你想找人说话，我建议你去找其他人，不要和小姐一样，总是找我。","alt":"voice/char_340_shwaz/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/genpcjuxxvz5yfq7mwapgwfztybsoc1.mp3","text":"我擅长的东西？杀人，保护人，还有......泡红茶。别露出那种表情，毕竟小姐的手艺......咳，总之，我很擅长。","alt":"voice/char_340_shwaz/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/66/n84o63tjisnso3tj7grv2z76u0efumi.mp3","text":"博士，根据迄今为止各种任务的危险程度，我认为，除了我的保护之外，